# sweep: --bare
# Every way in: a website name looked up, a feed address previewed, an
# address with no feed, a lookup with no network, and an OPML file sent from
# the computer. A feed comes off the shelf from its row's menu.
wait-for No feeds yet
tap Add a feed
wait-for Import OPML
tap Website or HTTPS feed address
wait-for Feed search powered by feedsearch.dev
type xkcd.com
tap Search
wait-idle 30000
wait-for Feeds via feedsearch.dev
expect articles
clean
shot feedsearch-results
tap xkcd.com
wait-idle 30000
wait-for unread of
clean
shot xkcd-articles
tap Back
wait-for Ready offline
expect xkcd.com
# An address that is not a feed says so and offers to change it.
tap Add a feed
wait-for Import OPML
tap Website or HTTPS feed address
wait-for Feed search powered by feedsearch.dev
type https://example.com
tap Search
wait-idle 30000
wait-for did not return a feed
expect Change address
clean
shot not-a-feed
tap Change address
wait-idle
tap Back
wait-idle
tap Back
wait-idle
# A feed address goes to a preview, not to feedsearch.dev.
tap Add a feed
wait-for Import OPML
tap Website or HTTPS feed address
wait-for Feed search powered by feedsearch.dev
type https://science.nasa.gov/feed/
tap Search
wait-idle 30000
wait-for Feed preview
wait-for Select to add
clean
shot feed-preview
tap NASA Science
wait-for unread of
tap Back
wait-for NASA Science
# A name looked up with no network says what is wrong.
scenario offline
tap Add a feed
wait-for Import OPML
tap Website or HTTPS feed address
wait-for Feed search powered by feedsearch.dev
type theconversation.com
tap Search
wait-idle 30000
wait 5000
wait-for Wi-Fi
clean
shot search-offline
scenario normal
tap Back
wait-idle
tap Back
wait-idle
tap Back
wait-idle
# Delete from the row's menu takes one feed off and leaves the rest.
expect xkcd.com
tap-id feed-menu-0
wait-for Delete
clean
shot row-menu
tap Delete
wait-idle
expect-missing xkcd.com
expect NASA Science
# OPML: the duplicate is skipped, a feed can be left out and put back.
companion feeds push scripts/fixtures/rss/subscriptions.opml --sim
tap Add a feed
wait-for Import OPML
tap Import OPML
wait-for subscriptions.opml
tap subscriptions.opml
wait-for Choose feeds
expect 1 new feed. 1 duplicate or unsupported entry skipped.
expect 1 selected
clean
shot import-choose
tap xkcd
wait-for None selected
expect-missing Add
tap xkcd
wait-for 1 selected
tap Add
wait-idle 30000
wait-for xkcd
expect NASA Science
clean
shot imported
restart
wait-for xkcd
expect NASA Science
# The shelf's refresh time reads as a time of day, not a database stamp.
expect Updated
expect-missing Updated 20
